<title>CANADA: Gulf Can, Talisman confirm gas find.</title>
<headline>Gulf Can, Talisman confirm gas find.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf Canada Resources Ltd and Talisman Energy Inc confirmed on Monday a &quot;major&quot; natural gas discovery on the Indonesian island of Sumatra.</p>
<p>Final results of testing and analysis of the Sumpal-2 well in the Corridor Block Production Sharing Contract area confirm a natural gas column of more than 800 metres, the companies said.</p>
<p>The companies said independent estimates place the total raw recoverable proved, probable and possible gas reserves for Sumpal at 8.2 trillion cubic feet.</p>
</text>
